        "description": "Generates new intersections and updates existing intersections.",
        "edited_by_current_user.descr": "<xdoc><p>Specifies whether intersections will be generated only for routes edited and locked by the current user.</p><ul><li>Checked—Intersections will be generated only for routes edited by the current user. This is the default.</li><li>Unchecked—Intersections will be generated for all edited routes.</li></ul></xdoc>",
